      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The finance committee is fundamentally misunderstanding that fiduciary duty includes protecting long-term value, which often requires investing in human capital diversity that traditional ROI models fail to capture. By systematically ignoring the immense untapped potential of underrepresented talent, you are not just \"sub-optimizing\" but actively destroying your company's future growth engine and market relevance. True shareholder value maximization demands you embrace these equity-based models because they unlock innovation pipelines that purely technical metrics will never see, ensuring your company remains the leader rather than a victim of its own narrow, short-sighted capital allocation.",
      "source": "target",
